<main class="doc wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Your data, your control</span>
    <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
    <p class="doc-note">
        This is a plain-language draft for the Kaon project, written with the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173) in mind.
        Have it reviewed by your adviser before a real launch.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Kaon is a system made by Team Kaon (IT-FRELEAN) that helps local carinderias take orders ahead of time.
        Questions about your data: <a href="mailto:jazellet5@gmail.com">jazellet5@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Customers:</strong> your name, mobile number and email, your delivery address (only for delivery), your orders, and how you paid.
            If you pay in advance, the screenshot of your payment. We use these only to take and deliver your orders, show your order status, let the carinderia confirm your payment, and keep your account safe.</li>
        <li><strong>Carinderia owners:</strong> name, email, phone and store details, to run the carinderia's page and orders.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>The carinderia you order from sees your name, phone, address, order and payment proof <strong>for that order</strong>, so it can prepare and deliver it.</li>
        <li>Kaon admins can create and switch off carinderia accounts. They <strong>cannot</strong> see customers' personal details, orders or payment proofs, and they <strong>never see anyone's password</strong>.</li>
        <li>We do not sell your data or use it for advertising.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we protect it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Passwords are stored scrambled (hashed). Nobody, including the Kaon team, can read them.</li>
        <li>Payment screenshots are kept private and can be opened only by the carinderia and the customer who sent them.</li>
        <li>New carinderia accounts are set up with a one-time private link, so only the owner chooses their password.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>While your account is active, and for the record-keeping the carinderia needs for its orders. You can ask us to delete your account and personal details.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may ask to see the data we hold about you, correct it, object to how it is used, or have it deleted. Write to us at the email above.</p>
</main>

